 flattened","mancanti dopo il n.":"missing after no.","non contiene audio: l'audio dei file viene tolto.":"has no audio: the audio of the files is removed.","non ha il canale alfa:":"has no alpha channel:","parziali":"partial","per nominare ogni video.":"to name each video.","premi Cmd+Shift+G, incolla con Cmd+V, Invio, poi <b>Seleziona<\/b>:":"press Cmd+Shift+G, paste with Cmd+V, Enter, then <b>Select<\/b>:","registro":"log","scarica i video":"downloads the videos","sequenza":"sequence","sequenza di immagini":"image sequence","sequenze":"sequences","sequenze di immagini":"image sequences","serve a yt-dlp per leggere YouTube":"needed by yt-dlp to read YouTube","su nero. Per tenere la trasparenza scegli un formato \u00abCon trasparenza\u00bb.":"on black. To keep the transparency choose a \u00abWith transparency\u00bb format.","tra le gambe del mecha \u00b7 anche cartelle e pi\u00f9 file":"between the mecha's legs \u00b7 folders and multiple files too","tracce)":"tracks)","trascina dentro la pagina la cartella <b>chrome-extension<\/b> (si apre accanto la cartella che la contiene, con <b>chrome-extension<\/b> gi&agrave; selezionata: trascinala intera, senza entrarci), oppure premi <b>Carica estensione non pacchettizzata<\/b>: il percorso &egrave; gi&agrave; negli appunti:":"drag the <b>chrome-extension<\/b> folder into the page (the folder that contains it opens next to Chrome, with <b>chrome-extension<\/b> already selected: drag it whole, without opening it), or press <b>Load unpacked<\/b>: the path is already in the clipboard:","trascinamento":"drag and drop","unisce audio e video e converte (VP9, Opus, ProRes)":"merges audio and video and converts (VP9, Opus, ProRes)","unisce audio e video e converte (VP9, Opus, ProRes, HAP, CineForm, WebP, EXR, chip Mac)":"merges audio and video and converts (VP9, Opus, ProRes, HAP, CineForm, WebP, EXR, Mac chip)","usa \u00ab+ File\u00bb o \u00abIncolla file\u00bb (dettagli nel Report debug)":"use \u00ab+ Files\u00bb or \u00abPaste files\u00bb (details in the Debug report)","va nella lista dei download":"it goes to the download list","veloce":"fast","velocit\u00e0 {0}":"speed {0}","volume uniforme":"uniform volume","yt-dlp e Deno da GitHub, ffmpeg dalle build per Mac di Martin Riedl (ffmpeg.martin-riedl.de). Ogni file viene controllato con la sua impronta SHA-256 quando \u00e8 pubblicata.":"yt-dlp and Deno from GitHub, ffmpeg from Martin Riedl's Mac builds (ffmpeg.martin-riedl.de). Every file is checked against its SHA-256 fingerprint when one is published.","yt-dlp impostato:":"yt-dlp set:","yt-dlp non trovato.":"yt-dlp not found.","yt-dlp non trovato: premi \u00abInstalla / aggiorna componenti\u00bb.":"yt-dlp not found: press \u00abInstall / update components\u00bb.","yt-dlp {0} \u00e8 troppo vecchio e ha falle di sicurezza note. Premi \u00abInstalla / aggiorna componenti\u00bb.":"yt-dlp {0} is too old and has known security flaws. Press \u00abInstall / update components\u00bb.","yt-dlp, ffmpeg e Deno sono installati: controlla gli aggiornamenti":"yt-dlp, ffmpeg and Deno are installed: check for updates","{0} file":"{0} files","{0} immagini singole":"{0} single images","{0} link":"{0} links","{0} link aggiunti":"{0} links added","{0} link chiedono l'accesso al sito: entra nel sito con Chrome, apri l'estensione DownConvertron e premi \u00abRiprova con il mio login\u00bb.":"{0} links require signing in to the site: sign in to the site in Chrome, open the DownConvertron extension and press \u00abRetry with my login\u00bb.","{0} link ricevuti dall'estensione Chrome{1}: controlla e premi Scarica quando vuoi.":"{0} links received from the Chrome extension{1}: check them and press Download when you want.","{0}: il sito chiede l'accesso, riprovo con il login di Chrome mandato dall'estensione.":"{0}: the site asks you to sign in, retrying with the Chrome login sent by the extension.","\u00b7 (HEVC: se era \u00abHEVC con alfa\u00bb Apple la trasparenza potrebbe non essere letta: esporta in ProRes 4444)":"\u00b7 (HEVC: if it was Apple \u00abHEVC with alpha\u00bb the transparency might not be read: export to ProRes 4444)","\u00b7 HDR: i colori potrebbero risultare pi\u00f9 spenti":"\u00b7 HDR: colors may look duller","\u00b7 audio":"\u00b7 audio","\u00bb non disponibile: \u00e8 stata scaricata la traccia originale.":"\u00bb not available: the original track was downloaded.","\u00bb salvato.":"\u00bb saved.","\u00bb: sostituirlo con le impostazioni attuali?":"\u00bb already exists: replace it with the current settings?","\u00e8 troppo vecchio e ha falle di sicurezza note. Premi \u00abInstalla / aggiorna componenti\u00bb.":"is too old and has known security flaws. Press \u00abInstall / update components\u00bb.","\u2014 mancano i codec":"\u2014 missing codecs","\u2022 aggiornare":"\u2022 update","\u2022 installare":"\u2022 install","\u2192 Accesso negato da Twitch: VOD riservato agli abbonati, privato o rimosso. Se sei abbonato, entra su Twitch con Chrome e rimanda il link dall'estensione DownConvertron (oppure entra con Firefox e attiva \u00abUsa login di Firefox\u00bb).":"\u2192 Access denied by Twitch: subscriber-only, private or removed VOD. If you are a subscriber, sign in to Twitch in Chrome and send the link again from the DownConvertron extension (or sign in with Firefox and turn on \u00abUse Firefox login\u00bb).","\u2192 Accesso negato da YouTube: premi \u00abInstalla / aggiorna componenti\u00bb e riprova.":"\u2192 Access denied by YouTube: press \u00abInstall / update components\u00bb and try again.","\u2192 Accesso negato dal sito (403): il contenuto potrebbe essere privato o richiedere l'accesso. Entra nel sito con Chrome e rimanda il link dall'estensione DownConvertron, oppure premi \u00abInstalla / aggiorna componenti\u00bb.":"\u2192 Access denied by the site (403): the content may be private or require signing in. Sign in to the site in Chrome and send the link again from the DownConvertron extension, or press \u00abInstall / update components\u00bb.","\u2192 Il sito chiede l'accesso: entra nel sito con Chrome, apri l'estensione DownConvertron e premi \u00abRiprova con il mio login\u00bb (oppure entra con Firefox e attiva \u00abUsa login di Firefox\u00bb).":"\u2192 The site asks you to sign in: sign in to the site in Chrome, open the DownConvertron extension and press \u00abRetry with my login\u00bb (or sign in with Firefox and turn on \u00abUse Firefox login\u00bb).","\u2192 Il video non contiene la traccia richiesta.":"\u2192 The video does not contain the requested track.","\u2192 Manca ffmpeg: premi \u00abInstalla / aggiorna componenti\u00bb, poi riprova.":"\u2192 ffmpeg is missing: press \u00abInstall / update components\u00bb, then try again.","\u2192 Premi \u00abInstalla / aggiorna componenti\u00bb (installa Deno e aggiorna yt-dlp), poi riprova.":"\u2192 Press \u00abInstall / update components\u00bb (installs Deno and updates yt-dlp), then try again.","\u2192 Sito o link non supportato.":"\u2192 Site or link not supported.","\u2192 ffmpeg non \u00e8 riuscito a creare questo formato con queste impostazioni: prova qualit\u00e0/codec \u00abAutomatico\u00bb o un altro formato. Se si ripete premi \u00abReport debug\u00bb.":"\u2192 ffmpeg could not create this format with these settings: try \u00abAutomatic\u00bb quality/codec or another format. If it happens again press \u00abDebug report\u00bb.","\u2192 yt-dlp troppo vecchio per queste opzioni: premi \u00abInstalla / aggiorna componenti\u00bb.":"\u2192 yt-dlp too old for these options: press \u00abInstall / update components\u00bb.","\u2193 Scarica da link":"\u2193 Download from link","\u21bb Converti video":"\u21bb Convert video","\u2714 trasparenza":"\u2714 transparency","Login di Chrome non pi\u00f9 usato: cancellato.":"Chrome login no longer in use: deleted."},"zh":{"(Chrome non trovato: aprilo e scrivi <b>chrome://extensions<\/b> nella barra degli indirizzi)":"\uff08\u672a\u627e\u5230 Chrome\uff1a\u8bf7\u6253\u5f00\u5b83\u5e76\u5728\u5730\u5740\u680f\u8f93\u5165 <b>chrome://extensions<\/b>\uff09","(boomerang: la clip torna al punto di partenza, ideale per i loop)":"\uff08\u56de\u65cb\uff1a\u7247\u6bb5\u56de\u5230\u8d77\u70b9\uff0c\u9002\u5408\u5faa\u73af\uff09","(codec mancanti:":"\uff08\u7f3a\u5c11\u7f16\u7801\u5668\uff1a","(con canale alfa)":"\uff08\u542b\u900f\u660e\u901a\u9053\uff09","(controllo aggiornamenti)":"\uff08\u68c0\u67e5\u66f4\u65b0\uff09","(copia senza perdita)":"\uff08\u65e0\u635f\u590d\u5236\uff09","(costante)":"\uff08\u6052\u5b9a\uff09","(gi\u00e0 all'ultima versione)":"\uff08\u5df2\u662f\u6700\u65b0\u7248\u672c\uff09","(installato/aggiornato)":"\uff08\u5df2\u5b89\u88c5/\u5df2\u66f4\u65b0\uff09","(installazione)":"\uff08\u5b89\u88c5\uff09","(interrotta:":"\uff08\u4e2d\u65ad\uff1a","(mancano ancora i codec":"\uff08\u4ecd\u7f3a\u5c11\u7f16\u7801\u5668","(non verificato: interrotto)":"\uff08\u672a\u9a8c\u8bc1\uff1a\u5df2\u4e2d\u65ad\uff09","(per rifarli con altre impostazioni sposta o rinomina i file vecchi).":"\uff08\u82e5\u8981\u7528\u5176\u4ed6\u8bbe\u7f6e\u91cd\u505a\uff0c\u8bf7\u79fb\u52a8\u6216\u91cd\u547d\u540d\u65e7\u6587\u4ef6\uff09\u3002","(presente, ma winget ha dato errore":"\uff08\u5df2\u5b58\u5728\uff0c\u4f46 winget \u62a5\u9519","(scheda {0})":"\uff08\u663e\u5361 {0}\uff09","(si apre da sola tra un istante; se non compare scrivi <b>chrome://extensions<\/b> nella barra degli indirizzi)":"\uff08\u7a0d\u540e\u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u6253\u5f00\uff1b\u82e5\u6ca1\u6709\u51fa\u73b0\uff0c\u8bf7\u5728\u5730\u5740\u680f\u8f93\u5165 <b>chrome://extensions<\/b>\uff09","(si apre da sola; la prima volta il Mac chiede il permesso di controllare Chrome: premi OK)":"\uff08\u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u6253\u5f00\uff1b\u7b2c\u4e00\u6b21 Mac \u4f1a\u8bf7\u6c42\u63a7\u5236 Chrome \u7684\u6743\u9650\uff1a\u70b9\u51fb\u201c\u597d\u201d\uff09","(winget codice":"\uff08winget \u4ee3\u7801","({0} doppi o non validi ignorati)":"\uff08\u5df2\u5ffd\u7565 {0} \u4e2a\u91cd\u590d\u6216\u65e0\u6548\u94fe\u63a5\uff09","({0} gi\u00e0 in lista o non validi)":"\uff08{0} \u4e2a\u5df2\u5728\u5217\u8868\u4e2d\u6216\u65e0\u6548\uff09","): niente Homebrew, niente password, circa 150 MB.\nPuoi interrompere con lo stesso pulsante.\n\nContinuare?":"\uff09\uff1a\u65e0\u9700 Homebrew\uff0c\u65e0\u9700\u5bc6\u7801\uff0c\u7ea6 150 MB\u3002\n\u53ef\u4ee5\u7528\u540c\u4e00\u4e2a\u6309\u94ae\u4e2d\u6b62\u3002\n\n\u7ee7\u7eed\u5417\uff1f","+ Cartella":"+ \u6587\u4ef6\u5939","+ File":"+ \u6587\u4ef6",", uscita":"\uff0c\u8f93\u51fa","-14 LUFS (YouTube, Spotify, social)":"-14 LUFS\uff08YouTube\u3001Spotify\u3001\u793e\u4ea4\uff09","-16 LUFS (podcast, web)":"-16 LUFS\uff08\u64ad\u5ba2\u3001\u7f51\u9875\uff09","-23 LUFS (EBU R128, TV)":"-23 LUFS\uff08EBU R128\uff0c\u7535\u89c6\uff09",". In un .txt puoi scrivere":"\u3002\u5728 .txt \u4e2d\u53ef\u4ee5\u5199","0 file":"0 \u4e2a\u6587\u4ef6","0 link":"0 \u4e2a\u94fe\u63a5","1 link aggiunto":"\u5df2\u6dfb\u52a0 1 \u4e2a\u94fe\u63a5","1 volta":"1 \u6b21","1 \u00b7 File da convertire":"1 \u00b7 \u8981\u8f6c\u6362\u7684\u6587\u4ef6","1 \u00b7 Link":"1 \u00b7 \u94fe\u63a5","10 volte":"10 \u6b21","1080\u00d71080 quadrato":"1080\u00d71080 \u65b9\u5f62","1080\u00d71350 post 4:5":"1080\u00d71350 4:5 \u5e16\u5b50","1080\u00d71920 verticale (storie)":"1080\u00d71920 \u7ad6\u5c4f\uff08\u5feb\u62cd\uff09","16 bit":"16 \u4f4d","1920\u00d71080 orizzontale":"1920\u00d71080 \u6a2a\u5c4f","2 volte":"2 \u6b21","2 \u00b7 Formato":"2 \u00b7 \u683c\u5f0f","2 \u00b7 Formato e ritocchi":"2 \u00b7 \u683c\u5f0f\u4e0e\u4fee\u9970","2 \u00b7 Video e audio":"2 \u00b7 \u89c6\u9891\u548c\u97f3\u9891","24 bit":"24 \u4f4d","2b \u00b7 Immagini":"2b \u00b7 \u56fe\u7247","3 volte":"3 \u6b21","3 \u00b7 Salva in":"3 \u00b7 \u4fdd\u5b58\u5230","32 bit":"32 \u4f4d","32 bit virgola mobile":"32 \u4f4d\u6d6e\u70b9","4 volte":"4 \u6b21","5 volte":"5 \u6b21",": condiviso con \u00abChiunque abbia il link\u00bb. Anche":"\uff1a\u5df2\u8bbe\u4e3a\u201c\u77e5\u9053\u94fe\u63a5\u7684\u4efb\u4f55\u4eba\u201d\u3002\u4e5f\u652f\u6301",": i file sono in":"\uff1a\u6587\u4ef6\u4f4d\u4e8e",": molto pi\u00f9 veloce, a parit\u00e0 di peso la qualit\u00e0 \u00e8 un po' inferiore.":"\uff1a\u5feb\u5f88\u591a\uff0c\u540c\u7b49\u5927\u5c0f\u4e0b\u753b\u8d28\u7565\u4f4e\u3002",": nel Finder sotto":"\uff1a\u5728\u8bbf\u8fbe\u4e2d\u4f4d\u4e8e",": nessuna trasparenza nel file di uscita. Per mantenerla scegli un formato \u00abCon trasparenza\u00bb.":"\uff1a\u8f93\u51fa\u6587\u4ef6\u4e2d\u6ca1\u6709\u900f\u660e\u3002\u8981\u4fdd\u7559\u8bf7\u9009\u62e9\u201c\u5e26\u900f\u660e\u201d\u7684\u683c\u5f0f\u3002",": premi \u00abInstalla / aggiorna componenti\u00bb (installa la versione completa).":"\uff1a\u70b9\u51fb\u201c\u5b89\u88c5 / \u66f4\u65b0\u7ec4\u4ef6\u201d\uff08\u5b89\u88c5\u5b8c\u6574\u7248\u672c\uff09\u3002",": premi \u00abInstalla / aggiorna componenti\u00bb.":"\uff1a\u70b9\u51fb\u201c\u5b89\u88c5 / \u66f4\u65b0\u7ec4\u4ef6\u201d\u3002",": scegli un altro formato.":"\uff1a\u8bf7\u9009\u62e9\u5176\u4ed6\u683c\u5f0f\u3002",": su quei file lo sfondo da rimuovere viene ignorato, per non rovinare la loro trasparenza.":"\uff1a\u8fd9\u4e9b\u6587\u4ef6\u4f1a\u5ffd\u7565\u8981\u53bb\u9664\u7684\u80cc\u666f\uff0c\u4ee5\u514d\u7834\u574f\u539f\u6709\u900f\u660e\u3002","<b>Come si usa:<\/b> clicca l'icona, scegli <b>Video<\/b> o <b>Solo audio<\/b> (o lascia le impostazioni dell'app), spunta i link e premi <b>Metti in lista<\/b> (li scarichi qui con <b>Scarica<\/b>) oppure, con Video o Solo audio, <b>Scarica subito<\/b> (il download parte da solo). Il logo dell'estensione apre DownConvertron.":"<b>\u4f7f\u7528\u65b9\u6cd5\uff1a<\/b>\u70b9\u51fb\u56fe\u6807\uff0c\u9009\u62e9<b>\u89c6\u9891<\/b>\u6216<b>\u4ec5\u97f3\u9891<\/b>\uff08\u6216\u6cbf\u7528\u5e94\u7528\u8bbe\u7f6e\uff09\uff0c\u52fe\u9009\u94fe\u63a5\u540e\u70b9\u51fb<b>\u52a0\u5165\u5217\u8868<\/b>\uff08\u5728\u8fd9\u91cc\u70b9\u51fb<b>\u4e0b\u8f7d<\/b>\u5f00\u59cb\uff09\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u5728\u89c6\u9891/\u4ec5\u97f3\u9891\u6a21\u5f0f\u4e0b\u70b9\u51fb<b>\u7acb\u5373\u4e0b\u8f7d<\/b>\uff08\u4e0b\u8f7d\u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u5f00\u59cb\uff09\u3002\u6269\u5c55\u7684\u56fe\u6807\u53ef\u6253\u5f00 DownConvertron\u3002","<b>Google Drive sul Mac<\/b>: nel Finder sotto <b>Google Drive<\/b>.":"<b>Mac \u4e0a\u7684 Google Drive<\/b>\uff1a\u5728\u8bbf\u8fbe\u7684 <b>Google Drive<\/b> \u4e0b\u3002","<b>Hai gi&agrave; una DownConvertron in Chrome:<\/b> prima premi <b>Rimuovi<\/b> su quella vecchia, poi caricala di nuovo come sopra. Questa versione ha un nuovo identificativo (serve a \u00abUsa il mio login\u00bb).":"<b>Chrome \u4e2d\u5df2\u6709\u65e7\u7684 DownConvertron\uff1a<\/b>\u8bf7\u5148\u5728\u65e7\u6269\u5c55\u4e0a\u70b9\u51fb<b>\u79fb\u9664<\/b>\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u6309\u4e0a\u9762\u7684\u6b65\u9aa4\u91cd\u65b0\u52a0\u8f7d\u3002\u6b64\u7248\u672c\u6709\u65b0\u7684\u6807\u8bc6\uff08\u201c\u4f7f\u7528\u6211\u7684\u767b\u5f55\u201d\u9700\u8981\uff09\u3002","<b>Una volta sola<\/b>, nella pagina <b>Estensioni<\/b> di Chrome":"<b>\u53ea\u9700\u4e00\u6b21<\/b>\uff0c\u5728 Chrome \u7684<b>\u6269\u5c55\u7a0b\u5e8f<\/b>\u9875\u9762","AAC (massima compatibilit\u00e0)":"AAC\uff08\u517c\u5bb9\u6027\u6700\u597d\uff09","APNG animato":"\u52a8\u6001 APNG","APNG animato + alfa (senza perdita)":"\u52a8\u6001 APNG + \u900f\u660e\uff08\u65e0\u635f\uff09","APNG: PNG animato senza perdita con trasparenza morbida (browser, Discord, Telegram). File pi\u00f9 pesanti del WebP.":"APNG\uff1a\u65e0\u635f\u52a8\u6001 PNG\uff0c\u5e26\u67d4\u548c\u900f\u660e\uff08\u6d4f\u89c8\u5668\u3001Discord\u3001Telegram\uff09\u3002\u6587\u4ef6\u6bd4 WebP \u5927\u3002","APP":"\u5e94\u7528","AVI: formato vecchio, per lettori e programmi datati. Video H.264 copiato senza perdita (fino a 1080p su YouTube), audio convertito in MP3. Niente copertina; i sottotitoli restano file a parte.":"AVI\uff1a\u65e7\u683c\u5f0f\uff0c\u9002\u7528\u4e8e\u8001\u65e7\u64ad\u653e\u5668\u548c\u7a0b\u5e8f\u3002H.264 \u89c6\u9891\u65e0\u635f\u590d\u5236\uff08YouTube \u6700\u9ad8 1080p\uff